OnlineYogaTeachers.com Mock-up
This is a standalone static website mock-up for OnlineYogaTeachers.com.
Files
`index.html` — the full website in one standalone HTML file with embedded CSS.
How to view locally
Download or clone this folder.
Open `index.html` in your browser.
How to deploy with GitHub Pages
Create a new GitHub repository, for example: `onlineyogateachers-site`.
Upload `index.html` and this `README.md` file to the repository.
In GitHub, go to Settings → Pages.
Under Build and deployment, choose:
Source: Deploy from a branch
Branch: main
Folder: /root
Click Save.
GitHub will give you a public website link after it finishes publishing.
Custom domain later
To use `onlineyogateachers.com` or `onlineyogateachers.com`, add the domain in GitHub Pages settings and update DNS records at your domain registrar.
